<title>USA: Labor Ready names Joseph Sambataro CFO.</title>
<headline>Labor Ready names Joseph Sambataro CFO.</headline>
<dateline>TACOMA, Wash. 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Labor Ready Inc said Monday it appointed Joseph Sambataro Jr. executive vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Sambataro succeeds Charles Russell, who resigned on June 12 for personal reasons, the company said.</p>
<p>Sambataro was a partner with KPMG Peat Marwick for 13 years in the accounting firm's the New York, Miami and Seattle offices and for the last seven years was managing partner of the Seattle office of BDO Seidman LLP, accountants and consultants, Labor Ready said.</p>
</text>
